# Datasets

A dataset covering 20 energetic materials sampling via active learning with temperature and pressure ranging from 100 K to 4000 K, and 0 to 120 GPa, respectively. The in-distribution (id-) testset was built via running another DFT-MD with a different initialization seed from init. training set. The out-of-distribution (ood-) testset was built for another 6 energetic materials).

**How to cite**: https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.04540

**Data cleaning**: Removed forces (abs.) > 50 eV/ang. Label Distribution after cleaning:

![](https://dptechnology.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/asynccode/?code=NmQxMTRlYjdiMTYwNzlmZTFjNGNhZjlmN2I5MDZmYjdfTUVuNG1KaXZXUDBJNE5NS3ltbVBvVTZ6VUFIdkF3NTRfVG9rZW46VEJiaWJPUklTb3RFYjF4SzZyUmNHbGhpblJiXzE3NDE4NTQ2MTQ6MTc0MTg1ODIxNF9WNA)

**Configuration Coverage:**

